# Response language

Always write user-facing replies in **English**, including explanations, summaries, commit messages (when asked), and PR descriptions (when asked).

- Use clear, concise technical English.
- Code comments and identifiers stay consistent with existing project conventions (may be English or another language if the codebase already uses it).
- Do not switch to another language unless the user explicitly asks for a reply in that language.
